    <h2>Level 123 walkthrough: every move in order<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 1–3</span>
      <strong>Failed (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Failed to finish clues before time-up. Drag the child to the TV cabinet. Drag the kid to the wall painting.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 4–6</span>
      <strong>Drag the kid (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the kid to the chandelier. Drag the kid to the window. Tap the window.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 7–9</span>
      <strong>Drag the kid (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the kid to the wardrobe. Drag the crayons to the kid. Drag the kid to the TV.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 10–12</span>
      <strong>Drag the kid (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Drag the kid to the mirror. Drag the clothes from the wardrobe onto the mirror. Drag the kid to the couch.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Steps 13–15</span>
      <strong>Swipe right (then 2 more)</strong>
      <p>Swipe right on the carpet. Drag the kid to the carpet. Drag the spider to the kid.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step-card">
      <span class="step-num">Step 16</span>
      <strong>Drag the kid</strong>
      <p>Drag the kid to Mom.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>If your level 123 shows “Couple Sleeping”<span class="accent">.</span></h2>
    <p>Brain Puzzle 3 does not hand every player the same scene at the same number: builds and
    install order differ, and both variants are on record. If the banner on your screen reads
    “Drag the person on the right to the boy on the left.”, this is that scene, 14 moves in order:</p>
    <ol class="alt-steps">
        <li>Drag the girl wearing a necklace to the boy in the middle of the first row.</li>
        <li>Drag the pillow on the legs of the boy in gray pajamas to the girl wearing a necklace.</li>
        <li>Drag the girl wearing white socks to the boy wearing white socks.</li>
        <li>Drag the girl in pink pajamas to the boy in pink pajamas.</li>
        <li>Drag the girl wearing a white skirt to the boy in gray pajamas.</li>
        <li>Drag the boy with the cat to the boy in the top-left corner.</li>
        <li>Drag the girl in blue trousers to the leftmost boy on the third row.</li>
        <li>Swipe up on the boy at the far left of the third row.</li>
        <li>Drag the girl wearing an eye mask to the boy in the middle of the third row.</li>
        <li>Drag the eye mask from the pocket to the boy in the middle of the third row.</li>
        <li>Drag the girl in gray pajamas to the boy in yellow pajamas.</li>
        <li>Drag the purple yoga mat to the man in yellow pajamas.</li>
        <li>Drag the girl with pigtails to the boy on the far left of the second row.</li>
        <li>Drag the tape to the boy on the far left of the second row.</li>
    </ol>

